#. Translators: Name of the add-on in the NVDA Tools menu.
msgid "&Native Speech Generation"
msgstr "&Native Speech Generation"

#. Translators: Tooltip or description for the Native Speech Generation Tools menu item.
msgid "Generate speech using Gemini TTS"
msgstr "Generar voz usando Gemini TTS"

#. Translators: Input gesture description for opening the Native Speech Generation dialog.
msgid "Open the Native Speech Generation dialog"
msgstr "Abrir el diálogo de Native Speech Generation"

#. Translators: Input gestures category name for Native Speech Generation.
#. Translators: Title of the settings panel in NVDA preferences.
#. Translators: Summary for this add-on shown in NVDA's Add-ons Store and Add-ons Manager.
msgid "Native Speech Generation"
msgstr "Native Speech Generation"

#. Translators: Input gesture description for speaking the selected text with Quick Speak.
msgid "Speak selected text with Quick Speak, or stop Quick Speak"
msgstr "Leer el texto seleccionado con Quick Speak o detener Quick Speak"

#. Translators: Input gesture description for speaking clipboard text with Quick Speak.
msgid "Speak clipboard text with Quick Speak, or stop Quick Speak"
msgstr "Leer el texto del portapapeles con Quick Speak o detener Quick Speak"

#. Translators: Error announced when Quick Speak is invoked in a restricted NVDA mode.
msgid "Quick Speak is unavailable in this NVDA mode."
msgstr "Quick Speak no está disponible en este modo de NVDA."

#. Translators: Warning shown when the user tries to open the add-on dialog twice.
msgid ""
"The Native Speech Generation add-on is already open. Please close the dialog "
"before opening it again."
msgstr ""
"El complemento Native Speech Generation  ya está abierto. Por favor, cierra "
"el diálogo antes de volver a abrirlo."

#. Translators: Title of warning dialog when the user tries to open the add-on twice.
msgid "Add-on Already Running"
msgstr "Complemento ya en ejecución"

#. Translators: Error shown when the main add-on dialog cannot be opened.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Failed to open Native Speech Generation dialog: {error}"
msgstr "Fallo al abrir el diálogo de Native Speech Generation: {error}"

#. Translators: Title of a dependency installation error dialog.
#. Translators: Title of an error dialog in Talk With AI.
#. Translators: Status shown when Talk With AI enters an error state.
#. Translators: Title of an API key configuration error dialog.
msgid "Error"
msgstr "Error"

#. Translators: Message shown when dependency installation is still pending.
msgid ""
"Native Speech Generation is installing dependencies. Please restart NVDA for "
"the changes to take effect."
msgstr ""
"Native Speech Generation está instalando dependencias. Por favor, reinicia "
"NVDA para que los cambios surtan efecto."

#. Translators: Title of the information dialog recommending an NVDA restart.
msgid "Restart Required"
msgstr "Requiere reinicio"

#. Translators: Error shown when this add-on has no trusted checksum for a dependency archive.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "No approved checksum is bundled for {assetName}."
msgstr ""
"El complemento no incluye una suma de comprobación aprobada para {assetName}."

msgid ""
"PyAudio checksum metadata does not match the checksum approved by this add-"
"on."
msgstr ""
"Los metadatos de la suma de comprobación de PyAudio no coinciden con la suma "
"aprobada por este complemento."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Failed to download or install required libraries. The add-on might not work "
"correctly.\n"
"\n"
"Error: {error}"
msgstr ""
"No se pudieron descargar o instalar las bibliotecas necesarias. Es posible "
"que el complemento no funcione correctamente.\n"
"\n"
"Error: {error}"

#. Translators: Title of a progress dialog shown while installing add-on dependencies.
msgid "Installing Dependencies"
msgstr "Instalando dependencias"

#. Translators: Initial progress message while dependency installation is being prepared.
msgid "Checking for required libraries..."
msgstr "Verificando librerías requeridas..."

#. Translators: Progress message shown when dependency installation has completed.
msgid "Installation complete!"
msgstr "¡Instalación completa!"

#. Translators: Message shown after dependencies are installed and NVDA must restart.
msgid ""
"The Native Speech Generation libraries have been successfully installed/"
"updated.\n"
"\n"
"Please restart NVDA for the changes to take effect."
msgstr ""
"Las librerías de Native Speech Generation se han instalado/actualizado "
"exitosamente.\n"
"\n"
"Por favor, reinicia NVDA para que los cambios surtan efecto."

#. Translators: Title of the dialog shown after dependency installation completes.
msgid "Installation Complete"
msgstr "Instalación completa"

#. Translators: Error shown when dependency installation fails.
msgid "Library installation failed. Please check the log."
msgstr ""
"Fallo en la instalación de las librerías. Por favor, verifica el registro."

#. Translators: Confirmation before reinstalling or updating external Python dependencies from GitHub.
msgid ""
"This will reinstall the verified PyAudio wheel for NVDA's Python runtime and "
"require an NVDA restart. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"Esto reinstalará el wheel verificado de PyAudio para el entorno de Python de "
"NVDA y requerirá reiniciar NVDA. ¿Continuar?"

#. Translators: Title of the dialog confirming a dependency library reinstall.
msgid "Confirm Library Update"
msgstr "Confirmar actualización de bibliotecas"

#. Translators: Confirmation shown when required libraries are missing.
msgid ""
"PyAudio is missing or incompatible. Click OK to download the verified wheel "
"for NVDA's Python runtime."
msgstr ""
"PyAudio no está instalado o es incompatible. Pulsa Aceptar para descargar el "
"wheel verificado para el entorno de Python de NVDA."

#. Translators: Title of the dialog shown when dependency libraries are missing.
msgid "Missing Dependencies"
msgstr "Dependencias faltantes"

#. Translators: Progress message shown while verified libraries are being extracted.
msgid "Extracting libraries..."
msgstr "Extrayendo librerías..."

#. Translators: Progress message shown while replacing the dependency library folder.
msgid "Installing libraries..."
msgstr "Instalando bibliotecas..."

#. Translators: Progress message shown after library extraction and installation.
msgid "Library installation complete."
msgstr "Instalación de bibliotecas completada."

#. Translators: Progress message shown before dependency download begins.
msgid "Downloading libraries..."
msgstr "Descargando librerías..."

#. Translators: Progress message shown while dependency download is in progress.
msgid "Downloading..."
msgstr "Descargando..."

#. Translators: Progress message shown while checking the downloaded dependency package.
msgid "Verifying libraries..."
msgstr "Verificando bibliotecas..."

#. Translators: Error shown when a downloaded dependency archive contains an unsafe path.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The library archive contains an unsafe path: {path}"
msgstr "El archivo de bibliotecas contiene una ruta no segura: {path}"

#. Translators: Error shown when a downloaded dependency archive would extract outside the target folder.
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The library archive contains a path outside the installation directory: "
"{path}"
msgstr ""
"El archivo de bibliotecas contiene una ruta fuera del directorio de "
"instalación: {path}"

#. Translators: Error shown when a downloaded dependency package fails checksum verification.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Library checksum mismatch. Expected {expected}, got {actual}."
msgstr ""
"La suma de comprobación de la biblioteca no coincide. Se esperaba "
"{expected}, se obtuvo {actual}."

#. Translators: Error shown when the updater cannot inspect the HTTPS peer certificate.
msgid "Unable to inspect the HTTPS peer certificate."
msgstr "No se pudo inspeccionar el certificado del servidor HTTPS."

#. Translators: Error shown when the HTTPS peer does not provide a certificate.
msgid "The HTTPS peer did not provide a certificate."
msgstr "El servidor HTTPS no proporcionó ningún certificado."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"PyAudio {version} does not provide a wheel for this NVDA Python runtime: "
"{assetName}."
msgstr ""
"PyAudio {version} no ofrece un wheel para este entorno de Python de NVDA: "
"{assetName}."

#. Translators: Title of the dialog for the "Talk With AI" feature (REAL-TIME conversation).
msgid "Talk With AI"
msgstr "Hablar con IA"

#. Translators: Choice label for the lowest reasoning setting in Talk With AI.
msgid "No Thinking"
msgstr "Sin razonamiento"

#. Translators: Choice label for low reasoning depth in Talk With AI.
msgid "Low"
msgstr "Bajo"

#. Translators: Choice label for medium reasoning depth in Talk With AI.
msgid "Medium"
msgstr "Medio"

#. Translators: Choice label for high reasoning depth in Talk With AI.
msgid "High"
msgstr "Alto"

#. Translators: Low-latency voice conversation model.
msgid "Gemini 3.8 Live"
msgstr ""

#. Translators: Voice conversation model with configurable background reasoning.
msgid "Gemini 3.8 Live Extended Thinking"
msgstr ""

#. Translators: Previous voice conversation model, with its original thinking levels.
#. Translators: Previous Live model for Quick Speak, retaining its existing thinking settings.
#, fuzzy
msgid "Gemini 3.1 Flash Live Preview"
msgstr "Gemini 3.1 Flash TTS Preview"

msgid ""
"PyAudio is not available. This feature requires a working PyAudio "
"installation."
msgstr ""
"PyAudio no está disponible. Esta función requiere una instalación funcional "
"de PyAudio."

#. Translators: Status shown after Talk With AI finishes enumerating audio devices.
msgid "Audio devices loaded"
msgstr "Dispositivos de audio cargados"

msgid "No explicit audio devices found. System defaults will be used."
msgstr ""
"No se encontraron dispositivos de audio específicos. Se usarán los "
"predeterminados del sistema."

#. Translators: Group label for connection status in the Talk With AI dialog.
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Estado"

#. Translators: Initial status shown while Talk With AI enumerates audio devices.
msgid "Loading audio devices..."
msgstr "Cargando dispositivos de audio..."

#. Translators: Status label. {status} is replaced with the current Talk With AI status.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Status: {status}"
msgstr "Estado: {status}"

#. Translators: Group label for Talk With AI controls.
msgid "Controls"
msgstr "Controles"

#. Translators: Button to start the voice conversation.
msgid "Start Conversation"
msgstr "Iniciar conversación"

#. Translators: Button to stop the voice conversation.
msgid "Stop Conversation"
msgstr "Detener conversación"

#. Translators: Toggle button label indicating microphone is ON.
#. Translators: Toggle button label indicating microphone state.
msgid "Microphone: ON"
msgstr "Micrófono: ENCENDIDO"

#. Translators: Label for selecting the microphone input device.
msgid "Microphone input device:"
msgstr "Dispositivo de entrada de micrófono:"

#. Translators: Label for selecting the audio output device.
msgid "&Speaker output device:"
msgstr "Dispositivo de salida de &altavoces:"

#. Translators: Checkbox to enable grounding with Google Search in Talk With AI.
msgid "Grounding with Google Search"
msgstr "Contextualización con Búsqueda de Google"

#. Translators: Opt-in toggle for sending periodic screen frames to the assistant.
msgid "Share screen with AI"
msgstr "Compartir pantalla con la IA"

#. Translators: Label for the model used for voice conversations, separate from Quick Speak.
#, fuzzy
msgid "Conversation &model:"
msgstr "Detener conversación"

#. Translators: Label for choosing the reasoning depth in Talk With AI.
#, fuzzy
msgid "&Thinking level:"
msgstr "Nivel de razonamiento:"

#. Translators: Label for the Talk With AI playback volume slider.
msgid "Volume:"
msgstr "Volumen:"

#. Translators: Informational label. {voiceName} is replaced with the selected Gemini voice.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Assistant voice: {voiceName}"
msgstr "Voz del asistente: {voiceName}"

#. Translators: Status shown when Talk With AI connects successfully.
msgid "Connected"
msgstr "Conectado"

msgid "Microphone: OFF"
msgstr "Micrófono: APAGADO"

msgid "Screen sharing is unavailable while Screen Curtain is enabled"
msgstr ""
"No se puede compartir la pantalla mientras la Cortina de pantalla está "
"activada"

msgid "Screen sharing enabled"
msgstr "Pantalla compartida activada"

msgid "Screen sharing disabled"
msgstr "Pantalla compartida desactivada"

#. Translators: Status announced when Screen Curtain stops an active screen-sharing stream.
msgid "Screen sharing stopped because Screen Curtain is enabled"
msgstr ""
"Se dejó de compartir la pantalla porque la Cortina de pantalla está activada"

#. Translators: Status announced after repeated screen capture failures stop screen sharing.
msgid "Screen sharing stopped because screen capture failed"
msgstr "Se dejó de compartir la pantalla porque falló la captura de pantalla"

#. Translators: Dependency error detail. {baseMessage} is the main error and {errorDetail} is the import exception.
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{baseMessage}\n"
"\n"
"Import detail: {errorDetail}"
msgstr ""
"{baseMessage}\n"
"\n"
"Detalle de importación: {errorDetail}"

#. Translators: Status shown while Talk With AI is connecting.
msgid "Connecting..."
msgstr "Conectando..."

#. Translators: Status shown while Talk With AI is disconnecting.
msgid "Disconnecting..."
msgstr "Desconectando..."

#. Translators: Error shown when Talk With AI cannot play received audio.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Audio playback failed: {error}"
msgstr "Falló la reproducción de audio: {error}"

msgid "Audio output device is no longer available."
msgstr "El dispositivo de salida de audio ya no está disponible."

#. Translators: The model may still be reasoning after an audio turn finishes.
msgid "AI processing"
msgstr ""

#. Translators: All model processing is complete; the conversation remains connected.
msgid "AI ready for input"
msgstr ""

#. Translators: Status shown when the first Talk With AI connection attempt failed.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Connection failed. Retrying in {seconds:.1f}s"
msgstr "Falló la conexión. Reintentando en {seconds:.1f} s"

#. Translators: Status shown while Talk With AI waits before reconnecting.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Connection lost. Retrying in {seconds:.1f}s"
msgstr "Conexión perdida. Reintentando en {seconds:.1f}s"

#. Translators: Error shown when Talk With AI cannot initialize its audio or session runtime.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Talk With AI could not start: {error}"
msgstr "No se pudo iniciar Hablar con la IA: {error}"

msgid "Unknown error"
msgstr "Error desconocido"

#. Translators: Status shown when Talk With AI is ready for a new session.
msgid "Ready"
msgstr "Listo"

#. Translators: Message shown when generated audio was saved but could not be opened automatically.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Audio generated, but failed to play automatically: {error}"
msgstr ""
"El audio se generó, pero no se pudo reproducir automáticamente: {error}"

#. Translators: Title of an informational message dialog.
msgid "Info"
msgstr "Información"

msgid "No selected text was found."
msgstr "No se encontró texto seleccionado."

msgid "Quick Speak cannot read text from a protected field."
msgstr "Quick Speak no puede leer texto de un campo protegido."

msgid "The clipboard does not contain text."
msgstr "El portapapeles no contiene texto."

msgid "No text was provided for Quick Speak."
msgstr "No se proporcionó texto a Quick Speak."

msgid ""
"No Gemini API key is configured. Set it in NVDA settings before using Quick "
"Speak."
msgstr ""
"No hay ninguna clave de API de Gemini configurada. Establécela en las "
"opciones de NVDA antes de usar Quick Speak."

msgid ""
"Quick Speak audio could not be played. Check NVDA's audio output device."
msgstr ""
"No se pudo reproducir el audio de Quick Speak. Comprueba el dispositivo de "
"salida de audio de NVDA."

msgid "Quick Speak failed. Check your connection and try again."
msgstr "Quick Speak ha fallado. Comprueba la conexión e inténtalo de nuevo."

msgid ""
"Quick Speak could not authenticate. Check the Gemini API key in NVDA "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"Quick Speak no pudo autenticarse. Comprueba la clave de API de Gemini en las "
"opciones de NVDA."

msgid ""
"The Gemini API limit was reached. Wait a moment, then try Quick Speak again."
msgstr ""
"Se alcanzó el límite de la API de Gemini. Espera un momento y vuelve a "
"probar Quick Speak."

msgid ""
"Quick Speak could not connect to Gemini. Check your internet connection and "
"try again."
msgstr ""
"Quick Speak no pudo conectarse a Gemini. Comprueba la conexión a Internet e "
"inténtalo de nuevo."

msgid ""
"Quick Speak could not generate speech. Try again or choose another model in "
"NVDA settings."
msgstr ""
"Quick Speak no pudo generar voz. Inténtalo de nuevo o elige otro modelo en "
"las opciones de NVDA."

#. Translators: The title of the main dialog window for generating speech.
msgid "Native Speech Generation (Gemini TTS)"
msgstr "Native Speech Generation (Gemini TTS)"

#. Translators: Model option for Gemini 3.8 Flash-Lite text-to-speech.
msgid "Flash-Lite 3.8 TTS"
msgstr ""

#. Translators: Description of the default model in the speech generation dialog.
msgid "Fast, efficient speech generation for everyday reading and narration."
msgstr ""

#. Translators: Model option for Gemini 3.8 Flash text-to-speech.
#, fuzzy
msgid "Flash 3.8 TTS"
msgstr "Flash 2.5"

#. Translators: Description of the creative Gemini 3.8 speech model.
msgid ""
"Expressive speech generation for narration, acting, and multi-speaker "
"dialogue."
msgstr ""

#. Translators: Model option for the previous Gemini Flash text-to-speech preview.
msgid "Flash 3.1 Preview"
msgstr "Flash 3.1 Preview"

#. Translators: Description for the Gemini Flash 3.1 Preview model.
msgid "Powerful, low-latency speech generation, very good for short audio."
msgstr ""
"Generación de voz potente y de baja latencia, ideal para audios cortos."

#. Translators: Model option for the older Gemini Flash text-to-speech preview.
msgid "Flash 2.5"
msgstr "Flash 2.5"

#. Translators: Description for the Gemini Flash 2.5 model.
msgid "Standard quality, responsive speech generation."
msgstr "Calidad estándar y generación de voz rápida."

#. Translators: Model option for the Gemini Pro text-to-speech preview.
msgid "Pro 2.5 (High Quality, need paid API)"
msgstr "Pro 2.5 (alta calidad, requiere una API de pago)"

#. Translators: Description for the Gemini Pro 2.5 model.
msgid "Premium speech generation with more realistic voices."
msgstr "Generación de voz prémium con voces más realistas."

#. Translators: Label for the text area where user inputs text to be converted to speech.
msgid "&Type text to convert here:"
msgstr "&Escribir el texto para convertir aquí:"

#. Translators: Label for optional instructions on how the speech should be spoken (e.g. "Happy", "Sad").
msgid "&Style instructions (optional):"
msgstr "Instrucciones de &estilo (opcional):"

#. Translators: Label for selecting the AI model to use for generation.
msgid "Select &Model:"
msgstr "Seleccionar &modelo:"

#. Translators: Radio button to select single speaker mode.
msgid "Single-speaker"
msgstr "Un solo hablante"

#. Translators: Radio button to select multi-speaker mode.
msgid "Multi-speaker (2)"
msgstr "Múltiples hablantes (2)"

#. Translators: Checkbox to show advanced settings like Temperature.
msgid "Advanced Settings (&Temperature)"
msgstr "Configuración &avanzada (Temperatura)"

#. Translators: Label for the temperature slider which controls creativity of the AI.
msgid "Temperature:"
msgstr "Temperatura:"

#. Translators: Button to start generating the speech audio.
#. Translators: Button label restored after speech generation finishes.
msgid "&Generate Speech"
msgstr "&Generar voz"

#. Translators: Button to play the generated audio.
msgid "&Play"
msgstr "&Reproducir"

#. Translators: Button to save the generated audio to a file.
msgid "Save &Audio"
msgstr "&Guardar audio"

#. Translators: Button to open the real-time conversation dialog.
msgid "Talk With &AI"
msgstr "&Hablar con IA"

#. Translators: Button to open settings specifically for configuring the API key.
msgid "API Key Settings"
msgstr "Configuración de clave API"

#. Translators: Button that opens a web browser to view available voices in Google AI Studio.
msgid "View voices in AI Studio"
msgstr "Ver voces en AI Studio"

#. Translators: Button to close the Native Speech Generation dialog.
msgid "&Close"
msgstr "&Cerrar"

#. Translators: Label for selecting a voice in single speaker mode.
msgid "Select &Voice:"
msgstr "Seleccionar &voz:"

#. Translators: Temporary item shown while the add-on prepares the voice list.
msgid "Loading voices..."
msgstr "Cargando voces..."

#. Translators: Opens the library for the single narrator; applies only to TTS generation.
msgid "View voice &library"
msgstr ""

#. Translators: Label for entering the first speaker name in multi-speaker mode.
msgid "Speaker 1 Name:"
msgstr "Nombre del hablante 1:"

#. Translators: Default name for the first speaker in multi-speaker mode.
#. Translators: Fallback speaker name used when the first speaker field is blank.
msgid "Speaker1"
msgstr "Hablante1"

#. Translators: Label for choosing the first speaker voice in multi-speaker mode.
#. Translators: Label for selecting the voice assigned to speaker 1 in multi-speaker mode.
msgid "Speaker 1 &voice:"
msgstr "&Voz del hablante 1:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Speaker 1 voice &library"
msgstr "&Voz del hablante 1:"

#. Translators: Label for entering the second speaker name in multi-speaker mode.
msgid "Speaker 2 Name:"
msgstr "Nombre del hablante 2:"

#. Translators: Default name for the second speaker in multi-speaker mode.
#. Translators: Fallback speaker name used when the second speaker field is blank.
msgid "Speaker2"
msgstr "Hablante2"

#. Translators: Label for choosing the second speaker voice in multi-speaker mode.
#. Translators: Label for selecting the voice assigned to speaker 2 in multi-speaker mode.
msgid "Speaker 2 v&oice:"
msgstr "V&oz del hablante 2:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Speaker 2 voice li&brary"
msgstr "V&oz del hablante 2:"

#. Translators: Opens keyboard-readable instructions for writing a two-speaker script.
msgid "Script &Help"
msgstr ""

#. Translators: Speaker identities used in library labels and announcements.
msgid "Narrator"
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid "Speaker 1"
msgstr "Hablante1"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Speaker 2"
msgstr "Hablante2"

#. Translators: No TTS library override is selected for this speaker.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{speaker}: use library voice for Gemini 3.8 (none selected)"
msgstr ""

#. Translators: Speaker-specific TTS override; unchecking returns to the built-in voice picker.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{speaker}: use library voice for Gemini 3.8: {name}"
msgstr ""

#. Translators: Selection works now but cannot be restored after NVDA restarts.
msgid "Library preferences apply for this session but could not be saved."
msgstr ""

msgid "Select a Gemini 3.8 TTS model to use the voice library."
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "{speaker} generation voice selected: {name}"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"For Gemini 3.8, write one spoken turn per line as Name: text. Use the "
"speaker names exactly as entered, including capitalization. Each nonblank "
"line needs a name and spoken text; blank lines are ignored. Names must be "
"different even when capitalization is ignored, and cannot contain a colon. "
"Put delivery directions in Style instructions; they apply to both speakers."
msgstr ""

#. Translators: Instructions for multi-speaker scripts when an older model is selected.
msgid ""
"Label each speaker's dialogue with the matching speaker name followed by a "
"colon."
msgstr ""

#. Translators: A two-line script example. Keep each speaker placeholder followed by a colon.
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{speaker1}: Hello!\n"
"{speaker2}: Good morning!"
msgstr ""

#. Translators: Title of the multi-speaker script instructions dialog.
#, fuzzy
msgid "Multi-speaker script help"
msgstr "Múltiples hablantes (2)"

#. Translators: Announcement after the advanced settings panel becomes visible.
msgid "Advanced settings shown."
msgstr "Opciones avanzadas mostradas."

#. Translators: Announcement after the advanced settings panel is hidden.
msgid "Advanced settings hidden."
msgstr "Opciones avanzadas ocultas."

#. Translators: Announcement after multi-speaker generation mode is selected.
msgid "Multi-speaker mode. Speaker 1 and Speaker 2 controls shown."
msgstr ""
"Modo de varios hablantes. Se muestran los controles de los hablantes 1 y 2."

#. Translators: Announcement after single-speaker generation mode is selected.
msgid "Single-speaker mode."
msgstr "Modo de un solo hablante."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The stored Gemini API key could not be decrypted on this Windows user or "
"machine. Please enter it again in NVDA settings, or define {envVarName} in "
"the environment."
msgstr ""
"La clave API de Gemini almacenada no pudo descifrarse para este usuario o "
"equipo de Windows. Introdúcela de nuevo en la configuración de NVDA o define "
"{envVarName} en el entorno."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"No Gemini API key is configured. Set it in NVDA settings, or define "
"{envVarName} in the environment."
msgstr ""
"No hay ninguna clave API de Gemini configurada. Configúrala en la "
"configuración de NVDA o define {envVarName} en el entorno."

#. Translators: Error shown if the optional Talk With AI dialog module cannot be loaded.
msgid "Talk With AI module is missing."
msgstr "El módulo Hablar con IA no está instalado."

#. Translators: Warning shown when Talk With AI is opened while multi-speaker mode is selected.
msgid ""
"Talk With AI currently does not support multi-speaker mode. Please select "
"Single-speaker."
msgstr ""
"Hablar con IA actualmente no soporta el modo de múltiples hablantes. Por "
"favor, selecciona Un solo hablante."

msgid "Feature Limitation"
msgstr "Limitación de característica"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Failed to open Talk With AI: {error}"
msgstr "Fallo al abrir Hablar con IA: {error}"

msgid ""
"This library voice requires Gemini 3.8 TTS. Select a 3.8 model or uncheck "
"the library voice."
msgstr ""

#. Translators: Error shown when the user tries to generate speech without entering text.
msgid "Please enter text to generate."
msgstr "Por favor, introduce texto para generar."

#. Translators: Temporary Generate button label while speech generation is running.
msgid "Generating..."
msgstr "Generando..."

#. Translators: Title of a speech generation input validation error.
msgid "Check speech input"
msgstr ""

#. Translators: Error shown when a voice is missing for one of the speakers being generated.
msgid "Select a voice for each speaker, then try again."
msgstr ""

#. Translators: Error shown when the text or speaker settings cannot be sent for generation.
msgid "Check the text and speaker settings, then try again."
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Speaker {number} must have a different name from the other speaker, even "
"when capitalization is ignored."
msgstr ""

#. Translators: Validation error for a missing or invalid speaker name.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Enter a name for Speaker {number} without a colon or line break."
msgstr ""

#. Translators: Validation error for a script line with a speaker but no spoken text.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Line {line}: enter spoken text after the speaker name and colon."
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Line {line}: start with '{speaker1}:' or '{speaker2}:' using the exact "
